-- Passage wg8-writing-with-evidence-p02
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('ea7b79be-9e7f-58c6-9d9f-a5b7458c66e9', 'wg8-writing-with-evidence-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-writing-with-evidence'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Draft: A Family Job at Gull Point$q$, $q$(1) In "The Lamp Keepers of Gull Point," Marisol Ibarra writes about the families who ran a lighthouse in the 1800s. (2) Ibarra shows that keeping the light burning was a demanding job that shaped the whole family's life. (3) According to the article, the keeper had to trim the lamp's wick every four hours, even in the middle of the night. (4) Ibarra also notes that the keeper wrote the weather in a logbook. (5) Ships passing the point depended on the light to avoid the rocks. (6) Lighthouses are tall, and some have more than two hundred steps.

(7) The work did not belong to the keeper alone. (8) Ibarra explains that keeper Abel Hansen's daughter, Clara, learned to clean the lens by age ten. (9) When Abel fell ill one winter, Clara kept the lamp lit for eleven nights in a row. (10) ____.

(11) In conclusion, the lighthouse was important.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
where public.passages.status = 'draft';
