   $q$Which claim best fills blank 2?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The farm in the article grows its strawberries in long, straight rows.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-not-claim"},{"text":"Grant's article about the farm is very interesting and well written.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-opinion"},{"text":"Robots will surely take over every single farm job within a few short years.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Grant presents the robot as a helpful tool that still cannot fully replace human pickers.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Grant presents the robot as a helpful tool that still cannot fully replace human pickers.$q$, $q$The draft gives the robot's strengths, its weakness, and the owner's choice to keep people, which all support a claim about a helpful but limited tool. The claim about robots taking every farm job goes far beyond what the article shows.$q$, 'draft', '43ab52c5-09ae-5dc4-899a-b9f6c7924340')
