   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it is a personal story that does not support the claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (12)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (8)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-concession"},{"text":"sentence (4)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (11)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (12)$q$, $q$Sentence (12) is a casual story about one relative and does not show that a school keyboarding unit would help. Sentence (8) should stay because it fairly grants a point before the writer responds in sentence (9).$q$, 'draft', '7b7dcb20-0bef-591b-885d-d40867279794')
