   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it does not support the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (4)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (13)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (5)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-supporting-detail"},{"text":"sentence (9)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-safeguard"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (13)$q$, $q$Sentence (13) mentions one friend's languages and shows nothing about whether the program would work. Sentence (4) must stay because it measures how many families the current system fails.$q$, 'draft', '53bae41c-9b40-5fc1-9fa4-1bdcdbb430d1')
