  ('24632eb0-ad3e-5501-acf9-46a5558d0e35', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g9-argument-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The phrase "For example" at the start of sentence (8) does not fit. Which transition should replace it?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In contrast to this,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-misplaced"},{"text":"As a result of this,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-effect-for-response"},{"text":"To address this concern,","is_correct":true},{"text":"Similarly,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"similarity-for-response"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To address this concern,$q$, $q$Sentence (8) describes rules that answer the privacy worry in sentence (6), so "To address this concern" names that relationship. "As a result of this" wrongly suggests the rules are caused by the concern being serious rather than designed as a response.$q$, 'draft', '53bae41c-9b40-5fc1-9fa4-1bdcdbb430d1')
