   $q$What is the purpose of sentence (7)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It supplies evidence that student interpreters protect privacy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-function"},{"text":"It grants that the opposing view raises a real issue before the writer responds.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that the writer has decided to drop the proposal.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-concession-with-reversal"},{"text":"It states the main claim of the whole essay.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It grants that the opposing view raises a real issue before the writer responds.$q$, $q$Sentence (7) acknowledges the privacy worry as serious, which prepares readers for the safeguards in sentences (8) and (9). The writer keeps the proposal, so the sentence is not a reversal.$q$, 'draft', '53bae41c-9b40-5fc1-9fa4-1bdcdbb430d1')
