   $q$The writer wants to revise sentences 14 and 15 to use dialogue. Which revision does this best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Brachiopods lived in shallow seas, and many of them lived about four hundred million years ago.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"no-dialogue-present"},{"text":"She told us what it was and how old it was, and we were both surprised.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-detail"},{"text":"I asked her what it was, and she told me that it was very old and from the sea.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-summary"},{"text":"\"A brachiopod,\" she said. \"It lived in a shallow sea that covered this valley about four hundred million years ago.\"","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"A brachiopod," she said. "It lived in a shallow sea that covered this valley about four hundred million years ago."$q$, $q$The correct revision turns the teacher's explanation into her own spoken words while keeping every detail. The other choices still summarize what she said instead of letting readers hear her.$q$, 'draft', '7df4e7ef-6ff3-5bbd-b157-131f58bd7411')
