   $q$Read the paragraph from a history essay: (1) "The printing press allowed books to be produced far more quickly than copying by hand." (2) "As a result, more people gained access to written information." (3) "Printers in many cities soon opened shops of their own." (4) "Honestly, it was a total game changer for everybody back then." Which sentence breaks the essay's formal style?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 2","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-informal-sentence"},{"text":"Sentence 4","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 3","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-informal-sentence"},{"text":"Sentence 1","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-informal-sentence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 4$q$, $q$Sentence 4 uses casual words such as "Honestly," "total game changer" and "back then." Sentence 2 begins with a transition, but "As a result" is formal and fits the essay.$q$, 'draft', null)
