   $q$What is the main purpose of sentence 11 in the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It gives the main evidence that students at Westbrook waste less food.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-support"},{"text":"It notes a limitation that Haddad reports, which makes the writer's analysis more balanced.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It introduces a new main claim that the rest of the draft goes on to support.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"It proves that the share table does not work and should be removed from the cafeteria.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-limitation"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It notes a limitation that Haddad reports, which makes the writer's analysis more balanced.$q$, $q$Sentence 11 admits that the table takes daily work, which shows the writer is weighing the evidence fairly. It does not say the table fails, so the choice about removing it overstates the problem.$q$, 'draft', '602f6ab6-9b85-57fe-8cfa-73635c90d39c')
